        <div class="csm-panels">
            <section class="csm-card csm-panel" aria-labelledby="csm-tables-title"><div class="csm-panel-heading"><label class="csm-panel-toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="csm-enable-tables" data-component="tables" aria-label="Include database" aria-controls="csm-tables-body"><span id="csm-tables-title">Database</span></label><span id="csm-tables-summary" class="csm-summary">None selected</span><button type="button" class="csm-panel-disclosure" id="csm-disclose-tables" data-disclose="tables" aria-label="Expand database" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="csm-tables-body" disabled><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></button></div><div class="csm-panel-body" id="csm-tables-body" hidden><p class="csm-panel-intro">Selected tables replace their destination counterparts. Rows are not merged; counts are estimates.</p><div id="csm-tables"></div><section class="csm-replacements" aria-labelledby="csm-replacements-title"><div class="csm-replacements-heading"><h3 id="csm-replacements-title">Find &amp; replace</h3><label><input type="checkbox" id="csm-replace" checked> Enable database find &amp; replace</label></div><p>Review the exact defaults below, uncheck any rule to skip it, or add your own. Replacements apply to selected database text, including serialized values; file contents are not rewritten.</p><div id="csm-replacement-rules"></div><button type="button" class="button csm-replacement-control" id="csm-add-replacement">Add custom replacement</button><p id="csm-replacement-status" class="csm-inline-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="csm-replacement-help">Matching is literal and case-sensitive. Longer matches take precedence; replacement text is not searched again. Destination identity and Trickle settings are preserved separately.</p></section></div></section>
