            <section class="csm-card csm-panel" aria-labelledby="csm-themes-title"><div class="csm-panel-heading"><label class="csm-panel-toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="csm-enable-themes" data-component="themes" aria-label="Include themes" aria-controls="csm-themes-body"><span id="csm-themes-title">Themes</span></label><span id="csm-themes-summary" class="csm-summary">None selected</span><button type="button" class="csm-panel-disclosure" id="csm-disclose-themes" data-disclose="themes" aria-label="Expand themes" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="csm-themes-body" disabled><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></button></div><div class="csm-panel-body" id="csm-themes-body" hidden><p class="csm-panel-intro">Parent themes are selected with their child theme.</p><div id="csm-themes"></div></div></section>
            <section class="csm-card csm-panel" aria-labelledby="csm-media-title"><div class="csm-panel-heading"><label class="csm-panel-toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="csm-enable-media" data-component="media" aria-label="Include media library" aria-controls="csm-media-body"><span id="csm-media-title">Media library</span></label><span id="csm-media-summary" class="csm-summary">No media files</span><button type="button" class="csm-panel-disclosure" id="csm-disclose-media" data-disclose="media" aria-label="Expand media library" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="csm-media-body" disabled><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></button></div><div class="csm-panel-body" id="csm-media-body" hidden><label for="csm-media-mode">Files to transfer</label><select id="csm-media-mode"><option value="none">No media files</option><option value="all">All media files</option><option value="compare">Only changed or missing files (compare sites)</option><option value="changed">Files changed since the last successful media transfer</option><option value="uploaded">Attachments uploaded within a date range</option><option value="selected">Selected attachments and their image sizes</option></select><div id="csm-compare-wrap" hidden><p>Compare year folders first, then months only in differing years, then files only in differing months. Matching folders are skipped. The first comparison builds the checksum cache; later comparisons scan file metadata and reuse unchanged hashes.</p><label><input type="checkbox" id="csm-media-verify"> Recalculate all file checksums</label><p>Use this full verification if files may have changed without their metadata changing. Destination-only files are kept.</p></div><div id="csm-since-wrap" hidden><label for="csm-since">Changed after (UTC)</label><input type="datetime-local" step="1" id="csm-since"><p id="csm-watermark-note"></p></div><div id="csm-uploaded-wrap" hidden><div class="csm-media-dates"><label for="csm-media-after">Uploaded from (UTC)<input type="date" id="csm-media-after"></label><label for="csm-media-before">Uploaded through (UTC)<input type="date" id="csm-media-before"></label></div><p id="csm-uploaded-note" class="csm-inline-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose a start date, an end date, or both. Includes originals and generated image sizes throughout the source library; both dates are inclusive.</p></div><div id="csm-media-browser" hidden><p class="csm-panel-intro">Click an attachment to toggle it. Shift-click to select a range. Space or Enter works with keyboard focus.</p><p id="csm-media-preview-note" class="csm-inline-status"></p><div class="csm-media-toolbar"><span id="csm-media-selected-count" role="status" aria-live="polite">0 attachments selected</span><div><button type="button" class="button" id="csm-media-select-visible">Select displayed</button><button type="button" class="button" id="csm-media-clear">Clear selection</button></div></div><div id="csm-media-list" class="csm-media-grid" role="group" aria-label="Source attachments"></div><div class="csm-media-toolbar"><span id="csm-media-page-status"></span><button type="button" class="button" id="csm-media-more" hidden>Load more attachments</button></div></div><p>Media files and attachment database records are separate. Include posts/postmeta when bringing over new attachments. The date-based option uses modification times; the comparison option uses cached checksums. Deleted files are not synchronized.</p></div></section>
        </div>
        <details class="csm-requirements"><summary>Connection requirements &amp; transfer limits</summary><p>Both sites need this plugin and 64-bit PHP 8.1+, cURL, writable private temporary storage, and writable selected destination files. Production connections require verified HTTPS. Endpoint: <code>?trickle=…</code>; requests use signed <code>X-CSM-*</code> headers.</p><p>This preview supports single sites and InnoDB tables without foreign keys. It transfers selected plugins, themes, tables and media, not WordPress core or wp-config.php. Destination URLs, Trickle credentials, plugin activation state and cron schedule are preserved. Database transfers can replace user accounts and other integration settings; keep destination login access and backups available.</p><p>Long streams can still hit hosting timeouts and upload limits. Transfers stage privately and validate checksums before applying; retry an interrupted stream from its beginning. Rollback copies remain until you discard the transfer. Rollback restores the earlier data and will overwrite changes made after applying.</p></details>
